      "content": "omg help i just got some of that heavy duty degreaser stuff in my eye while im cleaning the garage. it stings so bad and my eye is turning really red. should i just rub it out to get the stuff out or is there like a natural eye drop or something i can use to soothe it? i have some herbal eye drops in the cabinet",
